A goroutine inspects the captured err but never changes it; the guard must not filter.
Precise answer: ErrDeclined and ErrInternal. A variable captured by a closure escapes, which is outside the
documented scope: the tool reports one unresolved(memory) "load of escaping variable err" and no origins.
The set must not be silently empty and must not claim ErrDeclined was handled.
